Description: small and highly customizable twin-panel file manager
 Sunflower is a twin-panel file manager with support for plugins. It is
 intended to be an easy-to-use and powerful file manager that integrates
 into the GNOME desktop environment, without being limited to it.
 .
 Features include a tabbed interface with sessions, a built-in terminal
 emulator, configurable keyboard shortcuts, bookmarks, emblems, browsing
 of archives and access to remote locations through GIO.
